# Morning best-props checklist

When building or reviewing the morning / day-of best-props list:

## Ranker

- MLB: `scripts/rank_best_props_today.py` must read the clean **xlsx** when the folder CSV is missing (`outputs/<date>/step8_mlb_direction_clean_<date>.xlsx` or Sports/MLB).
- NHL: always **print** the NHL section when step8 exists (do not hold out). Warn that SOG/Blocks may need a card re-check; L5 alignment is not auto-verified.

## Pipeline coverage (five sports that often miss the ranker)

| Sport | What to check | Fix |
|---|---|---|
| CFB | Empty `outputs/<date>/cfb` while prior day has Thursday tips | Find failing step; ranker also tries date-1 step8 filtered to slate ET tips |
| WNBA | Stopped at step1 | If step1 is 0 rows → real no_slate; if rows exist without step8 → resume from failing step |
| NBA1Q / NBA1H | Stopped at step3 / empty folders | Resume `_run_nba_period_refresh.ps1` after full-game step4+ works |
| MLB | Board/xlsx exists but ranker only saw CSV | Ranker xlsx fallback (above) |
| NHL | Board exists but ranker omitted print | Print NHL (above) |

## NBA OKC@SAS / same-matchup stale board

Before trusting any NBA list row (especially OKC@SAS with Wallace / Dort / Hartenstein / Castle / Fox):

1. Confirm `game_date` / `Game Date` is the **slate date** (e.g. 2026-10-22), not last season’s playoff tip (e.g. 2026-05-28).
2. Confirm step1 `fetched_at` is **today** (same slate date).
3. Confirm tonight’s **opponent** matches the live board (2026-10-22 OKC tips vs **DEN**, not SAS — SAS was the May Finals stale Sports copy).
4. Confirm L5 is **RS-only** in the early window (`utils.nba_early_l5` + step4 `regular_season_only`) — no last-season **playoff** games (Apr 15–Jun) in `stat_g1..5`. Wallace Points L5 must not be the May Finals 17/11/7/5/11 tape.

If dated `outputs/<date>/step8_nba_direction_clean_<date>.xlsx` was copied from Sports/NBA with a wrong Game Date, treat it as stale: rebuild via `scripts/_run_nba_full_slate.ps1 -Date <slate>` from today’s step1. Do not let STEP D2b stamp a May Finals board onto October outputs. Keep `scripts/playoff_config.NBA_PLAYOFF_TEAMS` empty in regular season so `is_playoff_game` is not true for every Oct tip.
